// control-depthonly (t_678a4dab): a program whose ONLY output is depth - no
// colour at all.  The judge must derive its output set from the declarations
// (this container has no COLORn record and depthReplace set), read nothing but
// the zeta surface, and count painted pixels on that surface.  Reference-
// compiled by the stager.
void main(float4 tc : TEXCOORD0, out float depth : DEPTH)
{
    depth = tc.x * 0.5;
}
